# Secrets for the clean watchers, sourced by watch-movie.sh / watch-tv.sh.
#
# Copy to .env in this directory (gitignored) and fill in. Do NOT put secrets in
# the .plist files here: those are tracked in git.
#
# launchd does not read login shell profiles, so exporting these in ~/.zprofile
# works for an interactive run and is invisible to the watchers under launchd.
#
# TMDB v3 API key. Enables --lookup, which resolves a year for releases whose
# filename has none ("The.End.of.Oak.Street.2160p...mkv"). Without it those
# files are reported as "SKIP (unparsed media)" and never filed.
TMDB_API_KEY=
